flowchart TB
 MAIN[Router / owner session] --> W[Workspace / revisions and shared song pool]
 W --> S[Sources / bounded search and switches]
 W --> L[Library / songs, artists, albums, decades]
 W --> Q[Queue / desktop shortcuts and mobile sheet]
 W --> B[Builder / choose tags, review, name and keep]
 W --> P[Generated playlists / contextual maintenance]
 W --> T[Tags / vocabulary management]
 S --> INVALIDATE[Source change / invalidate selections and previews]
 INVALIDATE --> W
 Q --> AUDIO[One document SDK Player / exclusive queue lease]
 INVALIDATE --> STOP[Stop ineligible owned playback]
 STOP --> AUDIO
 L --> BULK[Bulk tags / frozen selection / undo]
 Q --> INPUT[Tag input / shortcuts / IME safety]
 W --> POLL[Visibility-aware polling / cached results]
